@startuml
title RötgesPortal – Typical topic status workflow

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #006080
  FontColor #444444
  ArrowColor #006080
}

[*] --> idea
idea --> announced : publicly announced
idea --> open : documented issue without an active procedure
announced --> open : follow-up remains unresolved
open --> consultation : public input requested
open --> committee : referred for preparation
open --> implementation : follow-up commissioned
open --> completed : titled subject concluded
announced --> consultation : public input requested
announced --> committee : referred for preparation
consultation --> committee : input evaluated
committee --> council : recommendation submitted
council --> decided : resolution adopted
decided --> implementation : execution required
decided --> active : rule or plan takes effect
decided --> completed : no execution phase required
implementation --> completed : work finished
active --> completed : validity or use ends

committee --> consultation : more public input needed
council --> committee : referred back

consultation --> completed : titled subject concluded
committee --> completed : titled subject concluded
council --> completed : titled subject concluded
council --> rejected : titled proposal rejected

state "Latest decision (recorded separately)" as decision {
  [*] --> adopted
  [*] --> rejectedOutcome
  [*] --> withdrawn
  [*] --> deferred
  [*] --> noted
  [*] --> noDecision
}

idea --> paused
announced --> paused
open --> paused
consultation --> paused
committee --> paused
council --> paused
implementation --> paused
paused --> consultation : resumed with public input
paused --> open : resumed without a formal procedure
paused --> committee : resumed in committee
paused --> council : resumed in council
paused --> implementation : execution resumed

completed --> [*]
rejected --> [*]

note right of idea
  A topic may enter the portal at a later status
  when earlier stages were not publicly documented.
end note

note right of paused
  "paused" is a cross-cutting condition.
  The next status records where work resumes.
end note

note bottom of decided
  The workflow communicates a typical path.
  It does not replace the formal municipal process.
end note

note right of decision
  A decision outcome never changes the topic phase automatically.
  ALLRIS workflow labels are not topic phases.
end note
@enduml
